    "content": "<p>A <strong>new Exclusive Pack</strong> is availablefor players on <strong>PlayStation&reg;5 and PlayStation&reg;4!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/06/223-PlayStation%20Bundle/PlayStation%20Stories%20(News).jpg\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you&rsquo;re a <strong>PlayStation&reg;Plus </strong>subscriber, check out the PlayStation Store to redeem the <strong>Pro Pilot Bundle,</strong> containing:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Eloise Donovan (Common Pilot)</li>\r\n\t<li>Trogon (Uncommon Paint)</li>\r\n\t<li>I Heart This (Uncommon Sticker)</li>\r\n\t<li>7,000 Credits</li>\r\n\t<li>35,000 Salvage</li>\r\n\t<li>5-Day Premium Account</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>You&rsquo;ll find the pack under PlayStation Plus Exclusive Packs on the PlayStation Store.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a><strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S&trade;</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One&trade;</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates.</p>",
